    "title": "Three-qubit involutions with a flag-preserving permutation",
    "full_tex": "Let $M$ be a gate of the form~\\eqref{core:eq:row} on three qubits whose permutation preserves the flag $0<\\Span\\{e_z\\}<\\Span\\{e_y,e_z\\}<\\F_2^3$, and let $H_*$ be as in the proof of Proposition~\\ref{gauss-lem:exceptional}. Then $[M]\\in\\C_3(3)$, or $[M]$ is conjugate to $[H_*]$ by an affine--diagonal Clifford gate.\n"
  },
